<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" version="1.2" xsi:schemaLocation="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2 xliff-core-1.2-transitional.xsd">
  <file datatype="xml" source-language="en" target-language="ko" original="../LogsCommandStrings.resx">
    <body>
      <trans-unit id="Description">
        <source>Display logs from resources in a running AppHost</source>
        <target state="translated">실행 중인 AppHost의 리소스에서 로그 표시</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="FollowOptionDescription">
        <source>Stream logs in real-time as they are written</source>
        <target state="translated">로그가 작성되면 실시간으로 로그 스트리밍</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="IncludeHiddenOptionDescription">
        <source>Include hidden resources in the output</source>
        <target state="translated">출력에 숨겨진 리소스 포함</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="JsonOptionDescription">
        <source>Output format (Table or Json)</source>
        <target state="translated">출력 형식(테이블 또는 Json)</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="NoLogsFound">
        <source>No logs found.</source>
        <target state="translated">로그를 찾을 수 없습니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="NoResourcesFound">
        <source>No resources found.</source>
        <target state="translated">리소스를 찾을 수 없습니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ResourceArgumentDescription">
        <source>The name of the resource to get logs for. If not specified, logs from all resources are shown.</source>
        <target state="translated">로그를 가져올 리소스의 이름입니다. 지정하지 않으면 모든 리소스의 로그가 표시됩니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ResourceNotFound">
        <source>Resource '{0}' was not found.</source>
        <target state="translated">리소스 '{0}'을(를) 찾을 수 없습니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ResourceRequiredWithoutFollow">
        <source>A resource name is required when not using --follow. Use --follow to stream logs from all resources.</source>
        <target state="translated">--follow를 사용하지 않을 경우 리소스 이름은 필수 항목입니다. --follow를 사용하여 모든 리소스의 로그를 스트리밍합니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="SearchOptionDescription">
        <source>Full-text search to filter log content. See https://aka.ms/aspire/cli-search for more details</source>
        <target state="translated">로그 내용을 필터링하기 위한 전체 텍스트 검색입니다. 자세한 정보는 https://aka.ms/aspire/cli-search에서 확인하세요.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="SelectAppHostAction">
        <source>stream logs from</source>
        <target state="translated">에서 로그 스트리밍</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="TailMustBePositive">
        <source>The --tail value must be a positive number.</source>
        <target state="translated">--tail 값은 양수여야 합니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="TailOptionDescription">
        <source>Number of lines to show from the end of logs (default: all)</source>
        <target state="translated">로그 끝에서 표시할 줄 수(기본값: 모두)</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="TailRequiresResource">
        <source>The --tail option requires a resource name to be specified.</source>
        <target state="translated">--tail 옵션을 사용하려면 리소스 이름을 지정해야 합니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="TimestampsOptionDescription">
        <source>Show timestamps for each log line</source>
        <target state="translated">각 로그 줄에 대한 타임스탬프 표시</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="GettingLogs">
        <source>Getting logs...</source>
        <target state="translated">로그를 가져오는 중...</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
    </body>
  </file>
</xliff>